            "inci": "CERAMIDE NP · CERAMIDE AP · CERAMIDE EOP",
            "desc": "Your skin barrier is 50% ceramides, 25% cholesterol, 25% fatty acids. Lahore summers strip it. One ceramide type leaves gaps. All three, plus cholesterol and phytosphingosine, rebuild it properly.",
